# Copy to apps/web/.env (git-ignored). Read at build time: only VITE_* variables reach the browser.
# Error tracking: a DSN from the local GlitchTip (`node scripts/glitchtip-setup.ts` writes it) or
# from sentry.io (Settings → Client Keys). Unset = off. Rebuild / restart the web app after a change.
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=http://<key>@localhost:8000/<project>
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://<key>@<org>.ingest.sentry.io/<project>
